WEBVTT

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:12.010
So what's the plan now?

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.760
Let me see...

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:18.510
First, we need to get these 
people somewhere safe.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.580
Easier said than done.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.490
Battlefields aren't exactly teeming with safe havens.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:29.270
Then can you take us to Maruruha?

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.280
Most of them come from there.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.080
Maruruha is a capital city near the border.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.020
It was captured by the Uzuurussha 
at the start of the battle.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.880
I expect it's under their control now.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.860
So we're jumping right into enemy territory?

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:51.170
But that means Oshutoru and the 
others are heading there now, right?

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.280
That's mighty fine then!

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.970
We can just have a little reunion of sorts!

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.310
Agreed.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:01.970
Then let's get moving.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.680
Sorry.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.980
Just hang in there a bit longer.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.420
I'm just fine!

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.980
I'm my daddy's little girl, after all.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:13.980
That's very reassuring!

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.310
Don't get too attached, or it's going to be hard to say goodbye later.

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:21.990
Then why don't we simply 
have them stay with us?

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:26.000
Yakutowaruto-san seems pretty
handy to have around.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:28.000
Give me a break.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.370
Looks about what, six thousand?

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:46.900
Three thousand for me,
and three thousand for you.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:48.480
Hardly a problem.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:52.690
Forward!

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:17.290
Reporting, sir.

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:23.010
Mikazuchi-sama and Oshutoru-sama have 
succeeded in rescuing Dekoponpo-sama.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.640
Naturally.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:26.390
Mikazuchi is my brother, after all.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:28.070
Yes.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.530
As per your original plan,

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:34.020
the arrival of all the Pillar Generals, including the Royal Generals,

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.820
has drastically altered the flow of the battle.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:42.110
Munechika-sama, the Guardian Protector,
has intercepted the enemy at the riverbanks.

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:48.540
Vurai-sama of the Mighty Arm has initiated 
large-scale combat in the canyons.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:53.040
Your forces, Raikou-sama, 
have deployed in the forests.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.050
Finally, Oshutoru-sama and Mikazuchi-sama

00:02:57.050 --> 00:03:01.800
have headed towards the Uzuurussha's main camp in Maruruha, acting independently.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.300
War is not merely a contest of numbers.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.920
No matter how many thousands they bring,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.370
they are no match for the Eight Pillar Generals.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:10.610
Indeed.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:13.560
All preparations are complete.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.600
The Emperor has given his orders.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:22.160
Now they will learn what it means 
to turn their blades against Yamato.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:29.140
So the Yamato dogs{orig: forces} have hidden in the forest to confuse us?

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:31.080
Damned cowards.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.320
Fools. We Uzuurussha are nomads.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.340
We know well how to fight in the forest.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:43.590
What?

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.550
Archers?

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.800
Calm down! They can't see into the forest!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:48.970
Their arrows won't hit us!

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:49.860
But—

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.520
Impossible!

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.810
How do they know exactly where we are?

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:13.600
Archers are to continue firing and 
push the rats back to 4-2-3-4.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.080
Infantry, move to 4-5-4-1.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:35.770
What?

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:06.010
Checkmate.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:14.270
Dance in the palm of my hand
to this melody I play for you.

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:31.160
You shall intrude upon this land no further.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.880
This territory is now under my possession.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.420
If you value your lives, retreat.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.480
What are you doing!?

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.430
Charge forth!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.430
Crush her!

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:53.180
Very well.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.040
To protect the people,

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:08.450
I shall become a man-eating demon 
and destroy all who oppose me.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:11.450
Impossible... Impossible!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:16.450
A battle this one-sided isn't possible!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:20.060
The Emperor has ordered your deaths!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.510
Get going!

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:21.770
Or you know what'll happen to your families!

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.940
Go!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:24.690
Move!

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.530
Good luck!

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.530
Dance! Dance!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:40.040
I have no end of pawns to sacrifice!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.490
That's one of the Eight Pillar Generals!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.260
S-Save us!

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:48.610
They took my wife and child...

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.580
Please, save us!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.290
We had no choice but this!

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:54.550
Please show mercy!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:08:00.390
The Emperor has ordered me 
to destroy all in my path.

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:05.310
What happened?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.420
What's going on?

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:19.200
That can't be—

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.910
F-Full retreat!

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.910
Run!

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:32.420
Ouro, all our forces deployed into 
Yamato's territory have been wiped out.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.430
The enemy is almost upon us.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.910
We're holding them off for the moment,

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.180
but it's only a matter of time 
until they break through.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.300
Your decision, my lord.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.190
My decision?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.540
Yes.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.250
We should move west.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.190
As long as you're alive, we can rebuild.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.990
Now is the time to endure.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.450
So you're telling me to retreat?

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.570
To abandon this land?

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.460
Ouro, I humbly beg you.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.070
Very well.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.680
We shall move west.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:18.470
Ouro...

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:21.640
But this is not a retreat!

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:22.970
It's a change of direction!

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.030
Yes, sir!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.070
Father...

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.890
So they're abandoning the 
fortress and retreating?

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.460
Weaklings.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:46.990
We'll follow them, Mikazuchi.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:47.750
Of course.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:51.750
Then let us see who can bring 
back the enemy general's head.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.750
You're on.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.430
Entua, are you still alive?

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.440
<i>If you still have your life, don't throw it away.</i>

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:09.490
<i>Even if it means drinking from muddy waters.</i>

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:22.780
<i>Once we're past this valley,
it won't be easy for them to follow us.</i>

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:27.150
<i>We'll hide in the darkness and 
get as far to the west as we can.</i>

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.790
Z-Zeguni-sama!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.260
Stay calm.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:38.280
You men protect the Ouro and cross the bridge quickly.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.280
But...

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.050
Go!

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.380
What are you trying to achieve?

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:51.420
I will not allow you to cross.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.310
No, you will.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:56.820
The Emperor has ordered your deaths.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:58.630
I see.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.130
If that's the case, then...

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:13.580
Did I not say that you would not cross?

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.770
This man...

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.920
He would sacrifice his life to protect his lord?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.840
You may have him.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:26.590
I'll go around the valley and 
pursue the barbarian chieftain.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.310
Understood.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.620
Father!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:04.380
Father!

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:47.420
So the Uzuurussha's main force 
has retreated already?

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:47.840
Yes.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:52.500
Big Brother and Mikazuchi-sama 
have followed in pursuit.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:57.600
But there are still many 
soldiers in the fortress.

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:00.660
Just surrender already!

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:04.110
I shall personally guarantee your safety!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:07.910
W-Watch it!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:13.200
Hey! I'm trying to be nice here!

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:16.500
I don't think you're in the position for that.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:21.380
Sister, I believe an appeal to their emotions would be the best option here.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:25.710
Hey, come on, misters!

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:28.380
Your mas are cryin' back home!

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.530
A-Are you hungry?

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:34.390
If you'd like, I'll bring you something...

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:37.390
There are injured in there, right?

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.900
So could you come out?
I want to treat them.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:45.360
I truly appreciate everything you've done.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.220
It's fine.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.500
Is this goodbye, then?

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.310
I doubt we'll ever meet again, but stay well.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.130
Oh, about that.

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:56.660
I'm leaving them here, but...

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:01.170
Shinonon and I were thinking of 
sticking with you a while longer.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:02.670
Seriously?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.990
I'm not from Maruruha to begin with.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.140
And Kuon made us an offer.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:16.680
Above all, I owe you for saving me.

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:20.820
So it looks like you'll be seeing us around.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:26.150
I still have no say in this stuff, huh?

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:30.700
Well, two more won't make that 
much of a difference at this point.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:33.950
What's that?

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:35.950
This is...

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:47.710
Shinonon!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.310
Are you okay?

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:55.390
Yeah.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.220
Thank you, Kokopo!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.820
Much obliged!

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.110
You saved us!

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.290
Thank you.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.480
You have my gratitude.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:03.990
Shinonon!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.480
Daddy!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.500
The capital, Maruruha, is right past that!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:27.750
Reporting!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:31.510
Multiple enemy units have concealed 
themselves within Maruruha!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.360
What is that?

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.510
Vurai...

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.540
One of the Eight Pillar Generals...

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.530
Vurai of the Mighty Arm.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.030
That's...

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.610
An Akuruturuka.

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:43.580
Akuruturuka?

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:48.580
Only warriors chosen by 
the Emperor and the masks

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:54.590
can unleash their power to assume that form.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.180
Masks...

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.590
You mean Oshutoru can too?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.850
Yes.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.110
H-Help me!

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:16.800
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.220
My family's there!

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:20.870
Hey!

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:51.020
No... Aren't they on our side?

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:57.870
Perhaps he is under the belief that those taken hostage by the enemy

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:00.030
have betrayed Yamato.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:04.540
But the Emperor wouldn't want this.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:06.790
This is...

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.240
war.

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:37.780
Haku!

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.710
Haku!

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.670
The Kamunagi of Chains, eh?

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:36.880
So that was all?

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:40.750
I'd have been more impressed if they 
were still willing to fight back, but...

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:44.260
Recall Oshutoru and Mikazuchi.

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:49.370
We have won this war.

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:33.300
I see.

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:34.710
So that's what happened.

00:22:36.030 --> 00:22:40.940
I promise we'll take good care of the survivors.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:46.280
Was there any need to go this far?

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:51.780
So many people died.

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:01.040
So this... is war?

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:03.390
Haku...

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:04.770
Let's go home.

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:12.870
Milady...
